menuconfig MODULES_LOS_GUIDANCE
	bool "los_guidance"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for los_guidance

		Converts body-frame LOS bearings (alpha = yaw, beta = pitch) from a
		gimbal-mounted camera into a NED-frame acceleration setpoint and
		publishes the result via the OFFBOARD pipeline
		(offboard_control_mode + trajectory_setpoint), so that
		mc_pos_control consumes it when OFFBOARD is engaged.
